{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「紫荊飛躍」一出即勝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/70bddd0dbb095786de04e284e767fd19/2026-10/r2_4.jpg\"/>\n<p>今日沙田第二場四班千四米爆岀大冷門，游達榮馬房的初岀馬「紫荊飛躍」，直路上從外欄後上越過「超拍檔」，爆岀三十四倍大冷贏馬，游達榮和周俊樂今季已合作贏岀五場頭馬。</p>\n<p>「紫荊」系馬主陳國泰和陳李妮名下的「紫荊飛躍」在港初出，即於周俊樂胯下在第二場四班千四米一出即勝。</p>\n<p>賽後陳國泰說：「我在英國的團隊和遊達榮一起引入『紫荊飛躍』，因為馬兒試閘末段走勢不俗，因此我們揀選牠回港。由於『紫荊飛躍』今場是第一次在香港出賽，我們不敢肯定牠是否適應水土，因此難言很有信心，見到馬兒今仗在港初出順利取勝，希望牠能夠繼續進步，將來可以躋身更高的班次。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc60e49d5af4fbda0ea96b1fc4b61c70/2026-10/6d3e883f-c293-44de-a81e-d9d3a99d6c5a.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc6f5874f10d618e62f2889018d348c0/2026-10/7e9d4665-b43b-4199-a302-e225aed80b25.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/22d888a6f7f54c0507f9ec6f5d2140cc/2026-10/23d720aa-3800-4847-a834-1a87977fb034.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9ccbd3b9f0c99bd28e1717cc34e61916/2026-10/39d3efd9-c6a4-4c77-ae4e-4d891066428c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/34a831fe92dc65f20ca0305c2e64015e/2026-10/123_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/528d6fb7f048d2e50f292a9afabeaf16/2026-10/582fde67-bd5f-4b6d-9d77-582ea9a66bb6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b85ce478eff687e55c230b4e5d7e288b/2026-10/3371fbc3-f217-4503-8244-b3f5e0967145.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3a3e43a2c7ffbb4f160fe11ed841e2f2/2026-10/4102ee94-81b5-44c6-affb-6ebf9a879153.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87d119aa4c0ea6c3ba1ce640bad65926/2026-10/69091e0c-af7f-4024-8e7d-50f2a66c2f93.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc06a637407971f1d6527ed9cbd564a1/2026-10/739160f6-1212-4ecb-966f-3bc7e085c765.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ce9c7b386dc64ec956f2f76821243b3/2026-10/83073246-83f7-41d9-ab78-2635cd96c72f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a52bfd5623dc0b7a803c3922ed865682/2026-10/a3de7f4d-2ac5-421d-9a6d-2fa0574fb425.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/10280624d882411346733cfc721dce7a/2026-10/b3cbe11c-bb1a-4844-aedf-463d6105d059.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc0026d9c4e80ac0a9572469d0be8c72/2026-10/dac4509b-2ccf-4c45-847f-962809503404.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0597a12474aeedeb3fcde7cadcd04cfa/2026-10/ddfc08b8-a3f6-41aa-ab62-9be54e892916.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a951e5b47f2294132b85a651b273873c/2026-10/e13ddfac-18ac-46e2-8a4f-374b44feeb1b.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c963c7d0de7dc4fcb561e29e3a6b610/2026-10/eb4f11e6-602f-4d5c-b70b-4a72792feef1.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:19:05.518084+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:11:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T12:38:04.993380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:35.308630+00:00","content_hash":"5388c2252b7c778a78c997e85d3f3e4145c8abf6f204222a450c0b81e6f69502","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}